  accTitle: Where controls act on attribute data
  accDescr: At intake, Import Regexp can normalize or reject a value. Optional warninglist enforcement can reject hits or save them with IDS off in soft free-text import mode. After saving, the attribute can be checked for warnings, correlated according to correlation settings, or selected according to export filters. Each box links to its guide section.
